            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "We will to that end display results of the upgraded Eta forecast of a severe zonda wind event of 11 July 2006. Zonda is the wind down the slopes of the Andes well known in the area east of the highest peaks of the Andes Cordillera, at the latitudes north of 35\u00b0S, where the Cordillera rises rapidly with several peaks over 6,000 m, such as the Aconcagua Peak (6,959 m).",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
