            "paragraph": "During the zonda episodes the temperature at various lee stations is known to rise rapidly, within 6 h or so, to values 10 and 20\u00b0 C greater than before, as a result of the foehn effect. San Juan (latitude 31\u00b036\u2032S, 630 m above sea level, ASL) and Mendoza (32\u00b051\u2032S, 754 m ASL) are two major population centers of the area affected by the phenomenon.",
